            "URL userinfo refused; resolved addresses in private/loopback/"
            "link-local/multicast/metadata/documentation/benchmarking/"
            "reserved/unique-local ranges refused (RFC 6890 + IANA).",
            "IPv4-mapped IPv6 (::ffff:a.b.c.d) re-applies the v4 deny rules.",
